#: confusb/kb.py:17
msgid "PC/SC service and CCID drivers"
msgstr "PC/SC-Déngscht an CCID-Treiber"

#: confusb/kb.py:18
msgid ""
"pcscd is the daemon that manages smart card readers; libccid provides the "
"driver for standard USB readers (CCID). Without pcscd the reader shows up in "
"USB but no application can use it."
msgstr ""
"pcscd ass den Dämon, deen d'Chipkaartelieser verwalt; libccid stellt den "
"Treiber fir Standard-USB-Lieser (CCID) zur Verfügung. Ouni pcscd erschéngt "
"de Lieser am USB, awer keng Uwendung kann en benotzen."

#: confusb/kb.py:22
msgid "OpenSC (PKCS#11, supports DNIe and other cards)"
msgstr "OpenSC (PKCS#11, ënnerstëtzt den DNIe an aner Kaarten)"

#: confusb/kb.py:23
msgid ""
"Library and tools for cryptographic cards. It includes support for the DNIe "
"(3.0/4.0) and the PKCS#11 module used by Firefox/Chromium and AutoFirma. "
"Older DNIe cards (2.0) may need the official DNIe module."
msgstr ""
"Bibliothéik a Geschirr fir kryptografesch Kaarten. Enthält Ënnerstëtzung fir "
"den DNIe (3.0/4.0) an de PKCS#11-Modul, deen Firefox/Chromium an AutoFirma "
"benotzen. Eeler DNIe (2.0) brauche vläicht den offiziellen DNIe-Modul."

#: confusb/kb.py:26
msgid "List readers"
msgstr "Lieser opzielen"

#: confusb/kb.py:27
msgid "Card info (ATR)"
msgstr "Kaarteninformatiounen (ATR)"

#: confusb/kb.py:28
msgid "List PKCS#11 slots"
msgstr "PKCS#11-Slotte opzielen"

#: confusb/kb.py:29
msgid "List certificates"
msgstr "Zertifikater opzielen"

#: confusb/kb.py:34
msgid "pcsc-tools (reader and card monitor)"
msgstr "pcsc-tools (Monitor fir Lieser a Kaarten)"

#: confusb/kb.py:35
msgid ""
"pcsc_scan shows in real time when a card is inserted or removed and decodes "
"its ATR."
msgstr ""
"pcsc_scan weist a Realzäit, wann eng Kaart ageluecht oder erausgeholl gëtt, "
"an dekodéiert hiren ATR."

#: confusb/kb.py:37
msgid "Open pcsc_scan"
msgstr "pcsc_scan opmaachen"

#: confusb/kb.py:40
msgid "AutoFirma (electronic signature)"
msgstr "AutoFirma (elektronesch Ënnerschrëft)"

#: confusb/kb.py:41
msgid ""
"Official Spanish Government application to sign documents with the DNIe or a "
"digital certificate. It is not in the Debian repositories: it is downloaded "
"from firmaelectronica.gob.es."
msgstr ""
"Offiziell Uwendung vun der spuenescher Regierung fir Dokumenter mam DNIe "
"oder engem digitalen Zertifikat z'ënnerschreiwen. Si ass net an de Debian-"
"Paketquellen: si gëtt vu firmaelectronica.gob.es erofgelueden."

